## First test

A registry date must not become a signature or payment date, and incompatible
financial perimeters must not be added. The fixture preserves both claims with
their source roles.

## Actions and exit criteria

Retrieve every frozen South Africa census item with raw-byte/hash provenance;
extract candidates deterministically; review dispositions and admit only
supported canonical facts. Preserve programme/component relations, source
currency, lifecycle distinctions, corrections, blocked routes and unknowns.
Complete only when every census item has a documented disposition and a clean
replay reproduces the candidate set without duplication.

